{"meta":{},"result":{"jobOpening":{"jobOpeningShareUrl":"https:\/\/vra.bamboohr.com\/careers\/32","jobOpeningName":"Housekeeping supervisor \/ manager, vacation rental properties","jobOpeningStatus":"Open","jobCategoryId":null,"departmentId":"18418","departmentLabel":"Cleaning","employmentStatusLabel":"Full-Time","employmentType":null,"location":{"city":"South Lake Tahoe","state":"California","postalCode":"96150","addressCountry":"United States"},"atsLocation":{"country":null,"countryId":null,"state":null,"city":null},"description":"<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Greetings, Lake Tahoe!<\/span><\/p>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">We\u2019re looking for an experienced <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Housekeeping Supervisor or Manager<\/span> to help oversee our Lake Tahoe vacation rental housekeeping operations. If you have a background in housekeeping and team supervision, we\u2019d love to hear from you!\u00a0 We are open to different levels of experience and are happy to help to develop the right individual!\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: georgia, palatino; font-weight: bold;\">About Vacation Rental Assistance (VRA)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">VRA is a fast-paced, Tahoe-born company with over 15 years of innovation in vacation rental housekeeping. We offer flexible, growth-oriented roles that support an active lifestyle. Our team values professionalism, motivation, and collaboration.\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: georgia, palatino; font-weight: bold;\">About the Role<\/span><\/p>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">This role supports the leadership of our housekeeping team and includes:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Staff scheduling, training, and support<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Quality control and performance reviews<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Occasional field visits (South &amp; North Lake)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Admin tasks and hands-on cleaning when needed<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">After-hours availability for scheduling or team support<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Collaborating with operations and dispatch teams<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Contributing to seasonal planning and deep clean strategy<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Candidate must be located in South Tahoe \/ Stateline region and be okay with occasional visits to North Tahoe \/ Truckee.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><br><br><\/p>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: georgia, palatino; font-weight: bold;\">What We're Looking For<\/span><\/p>\n<p><br><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">You\u2019re a self-motivated, experienced housekeeper and supervisor who:<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Communicates well and stays calm under pressure<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Leads by example and enjoys supporting a team<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Has a strong work ethic and a solution-focused mindset<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Wants to grow with a company and contribute ideas<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: georgia, palatino; font-weight: bold;\">Requirements<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Experienced housekeeper\u00a0<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Experience supervising or managing individuals or teams (housekeeping, or otherwise)<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Strong communication and interpersonal skills<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">4x4 or AWD vehicle with valid driver\u2019s license and insurance<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Able to lift 50 lbs and perform manual labor for extended periods<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Comfortable using basic phone apps<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Able to clearly communicate in writing and in person<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Willing to travel throughout Tahoe\/Truckee as needed<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: georgia, palatino; font-weight: bold;\">Perks &amp; Pay<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">$60,000 to $75,000+ \/ year, dependent upon experience and duties<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">PTO starting Day 1<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Paid drive time and gas<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Flexible schedules<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Opportunities for raises, bonuses, and advancement<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Company parties and team activities<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino;\">Organized systems and supportive team environment<\/span><br><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><br><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); font-family: georgia, palatino; font-weight: bold;\">How to Apply<\/span><\/p>\n<ol>\n